  "instruction": "Contains Duplicate",
  "output": "    public boolean containsDuplicate(int[] nums) {\n        HashMap<Integer, Integer> map = new HashMap<>();\n\n        for (Integer num : nums) {\n            if (map.containsKey(num)) {\n                return true;\n            }\n            map.put(num, 1);\n        }\n\n        return false;\n    }",
